/-!
# Exhausting the J2 Sylow restriction kernel

Fixed-point patterns of 13 short words constrain the images of the 6
orbit representatives. Words then determine the commuting permutation on
all 100 points. The resulting 256 candidates are checked explicitly.
All finite equalities are kernel checked. The generator comparisons link the
certificate to the unchanged ATLAS carrier, including its action convention.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith 16.1.6, printed p.1172; retained ATLAS
J2G1-p100B0 data. The accompanying generator supplies witnesses only.
-/

